search report","content":"I’m structuring the report in the requested order: executive summary, recommendations, detailed analysis, M0 delivery plan, and risks and decisions. I’ll distinguish repository evidence from external project research, preserve the established Avalonia/Rust architecture, and clearly mark unresolved items as “未指定” rather than inventing details.","chunks":[],"finished":true},{"summary":"Organized the Chinese research report","content":"","chunks":[],"finished":true}],"source_analysis_msg_id":"428e24f4-ea52-413d-b097-fe0c2dcc1e42"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_status":"is_reasoning"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},{"id":"7b25259b-8ffa-44f1-840c-57fb66722de4","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":1789992446.171981,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"reasoning_recap","content":"Worked for 7m 11s"},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":1.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_status":"reasoning_ended"},"recipient":"all","channel":null},{"id":"1421bf49-94d4-5e7a-bbc5-7779ea98e716","author":{"role":"assistant","name":null,"metadata":{}},"create_time":null,"update_time":null,"content":{"content_type":"reasoning_recap","content":""},"status":"finished_successfully","end_turn":false,"weight":0.0,"metadata":{"reasoning_title":"Generated report on AAOS 前端全量设计任务研究报告"},"recipient":"all","channel":null}],"source_searches":[{"key":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/contents","domain":"api.github.com","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/contents","titles":[{"key":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/contents-contents","title":"contents","items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/contents","domain":"api.github.com","title":"contents","cloud_doc_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DTALEX66/ArcheAxis-Knowledge-OS/contents"}]}]},{"key":"htt